---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Meet Rachel Connell, a certified professional coach passionate about empowering women to live intentionally and walk in their God-given purpose.">
  <Header />

  <!-- ===== Page Hero ===== -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__bg">
      <img src="/images/botanical-texture.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
      <div class="page-hero__overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow animate-in" style="color: var(--color-cream-light);">About</span>
      <h1 class="animate-in animate-in--delay-1" style="color: var(--color-warm-white);">Meet Rachel</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Intro ===== -->
  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="about-image" data-animate="slide-left">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Rachel Connell" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-intro" data-animate="slide-right">
          <span class="eyebrow">Hello, I'm Rachel</span>
          <h2>Thank you for <span class="serif-italic">stopping by</span></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>
            I am deeply passionate about the possibilities that can open up to women of God and His Kingdom when they utilize coaching as a tool in their journey. That's why I do what I do. I'm eager to get to know you and see how we can work together as you continue on the next part of your journey.
          </p>
          <p>
            I have worked as a coach since 2020, starting in a corporate environment where I specialized in education and career coaching. I partnered with hundreds of clients: from recent high school grads to men and women nearing retirement or starting second careers.
          </p>
          <p>
            While working in this environment, I earned my Professional Coach Certification through an ICF-accredited academy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Journey ===== -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="journey" data-animate>
        <span class="eyebrow">My Journey</span>
        <h2>From Bible college to <span class="serif-italic">coaching with purpose</span></h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>
          Prior to stepping into the workforce, I attended and graduated from Moody Bible Institute where I earned a Bachelor's of Theology. The shift from Bible college to working in the corporate world, and becoming a wife and a mom within that time, has deeply impacted my beliefs and convictions around coaching, and the powerful impact it can have.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2026, I stepped away from coaching in the corporate world and began Rachel Connell Coaching. My passion is coaching women as they navigate the variety of transitions and seasons they walk through.
        </p>
        <p>
          I would have benefited so deeply from having a personal coach at each pivotal moment and season in my life. I believe it would've challenged me to grapple with decisions, beliefs, habits, and so much more in a deeply impactful way.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          So that's why I coach other women. Christian women, we are meant to be powerful tools on this earth in the Hands of our Father.
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          This world is distracting, and coaching is a tool to peel back those distractions, expose the lies you believe, and address the habits and rhythms that keep you chained. Coaching can then help to set you firmly on the path God has written out for you.
        </p>
        <p class="lead" style="color: var(--color-terracotta); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
          I hope to partner with you in your journey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Philosophy ===== -->
  <section class="section section--white" id="philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div data-animate="slide-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">Philosophy</span>
          <h2>My goal is to help you live <span class="serif-italic">intentionally</span></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>
            How easy it is to just let life carry us, for better or for worse. We can start to see ourselves as people who life just happens to. And it's true, life does just happen, but we do have the ability to respond and act.
          </p>
          <p>
            That can be easier said than done. When you lose a job, what does moving forward look like? When your relationship ends, how do you rebuild your identity and your life? When your children are all out of the house, where do you find yourself? Life happens, but you get to choose how to respond.
          </p>
          <p>
            It can seem like there isn't time to pause when "life happens", but I'd gently challenge that belief by stating that it's those very moments when it's the most important time to pause.
          </p>
          <p>
            Coaching is an intentional pause where we evaluate, gain deeper levels of awareness and ensure we are responding rather than reacting.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card" data-animate="slide-right">
          <div class="card philosophy-accent-card">
            <p>
              Coaching is a place where you can come when the path in front of you feels turbulent. Whether it's due to a lack of clarity, insecurity, upheaval in your life, or a general sense of disappointment, coaching can be a soft landing place.
            </p>
            <p>
              But in coaching you don't just stay there; you gain the insight and tools necessary to take the next step on your path. Coaching is meant to support you in gaining wisdom and discernment within your situation and to be able to make decisions that take you forward on the journey you are meant to be on.
            </p>
            <p class="philosophy-accent-card__cta serif-italic">
              Know your purpose. Live intentionally. Don't merely exist.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Who I Coach ===== -->
  <section class="section section--sage" id="who-i-coach">
    <div class="container container--narrow text-center" data-animate>
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-cream-light);">Who I Coach</span>
      <h2>Women in <span class="serif-italic">every season</span></h2>
      <div class="divider divider--center" style="background: rgba(255,253,249,0.3);"></div>
      <p class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto var(--space-md); color: rgba(255,253,249,0.85);">
        I coach women throughout the many different seasons they find themselves in. Women wear many hats throughout their lives, and as a coach I aim to support them so that as life swirls around them, they feel grounded and steady in how they move forward.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 auto var(--space-md); color: rgba(255,253,249,0.75);">
        Each moment in life is significant, and when you are in a period of transition, upheaval or change, coaching can be a tool that helps you walk into uncertainty with confidence and peace.
      </p>

      <p style="margin: var(--space-lg) auto 0; color: rgba(255,253,249,0.8);">
        The women I coach have unique and varied stories. No matter the unique details, my job as a coach is to help them along on their journey as women who are <strong>grounded, confident, and unshakeable</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Credentials ===== -->
  <section class="section section--white" id="credentials">
    <div class="container container--narrow text-center" data-animate>
      <span class="eyebrow">Credentials</span>
      <h2>Certified & <span class="serif-italic">qualified</span></h2>
      <div class="divider divider--center"></div>
      <div class="credential-card card">
        <h3>Advanced Professional Coaching Certification</h3>
        <p style="margin: var(--space-sm) auto 0;">
          Through the Academy of Creative Coaching, an International Coach Federation (ICF) Level 2 Training. An immersive advanced program preparing coaches to meet the highest international standards. This certification means I have completed 125 hours of coaching education, 400 hours of coaching experience since completing my program, and 10 hours of mentor coaching.
        </p>
        <div class="credential-badge">
          <span class="credential-badge__label">ICF Level 2</span>
          <span class="credential-badge__sub">Accredited Training</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Theological Beliefs ===== -->
  <section class="section section--cream" id="beliefs">
    <div class="container container--narrow" data-animate>
      <span class="eyebrow">Theological Beliefs</span>
      <h2>What I believe</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>
        As a Christian coach, I think it's important that you are able to see what I believe theologically. You do not have to agree with me 100% in order for us to work together! But I believe that transparency on my side about my beliefs is important as you consider what voices you invite into the deep and personal parts of your life.
      </p>
      <p>
        In short, I am an Evangelical Christian. I believe in the inerrancy of the Bible, the Godhood of Jesus Christ, and that it is by His life, death, and resurrection that we are able to believe and be saved by grace, through faith.
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe in the power of the Holy Spirit to enliven us to live holy lives and to know what is good and right. There's a whole lot more I could write, but I'm happy to discuss any questions you may have!
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Let's Talk</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ===== Page Hero ===== */
  .page-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-3xl)) 0 var(--space-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 320px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .page-hero__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .page-hero__bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .page-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(142, 85, 48, 0.85), rgba(107, 125, 94, 0.8));
  }

  .page-hero__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ===== About Image ===== */
  .about-image .img-frame {
    max-width: 450px;
  }

  /* ===== Philosophy Card ===== */
  .philosophy-accent-card {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border: none;
  }

  .philosophy-accent-card p {
    max-width: none;
  }

  .philosophy-accent-card__cta {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* ===== Who Cards ===== */
  .who-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .who-card {
    background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.15);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
  }

  .who-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .who-card__icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .who-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .who-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.7);
  }

  /* ===== Credential ===== */
  .credential-card {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .credential-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .credential-badge__label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
  }

  .credential-badge__sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-lighter);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .who-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .page-hero {
      min-height: 240px;
    }
  }
</style>
